  "Interpretation": [
    "The normal Locator.click call remained at locator resolution; no Input.dispatchMouseEvent SEND or trusted Continue input is retained in the complete driver/DOM logs.",
    "Composer appears before click with a disabled loading shell. App renders this when activeRoute is home but menu is null; shell publishes ready/menu only after all six initial GETs settle.",
    "Main-menu/session complete 200, while game-screen remains unfinished throughout the click timeout and browser lifetime; server later stops 499 after browser close. The reason for endpoint delay is not established.",
    "No navigation-barrier diagnosis is supported: existing no_wait_after=True disables it, and this run never reaches mouse dispatch.",
